    },
    "body": "The bounded original-parent pair run improves the conditional episode from 5/15 to 6/15 solely by correcting EOS. It still fails the complete episode gate; the candidate remains unselected and accepted whole-answer performance remains 8/512.\n\nThis preserves the negative coefficients, exact report/config/runtime identities, source reviews, independent saved-arithmetic audit, cumulative resource ledger and private-store/iCloud recovery receipts. Main's current-state entry records the next saved-journal question: whether the earliest residual correction was proposed and vetoed, or never proposed by the bounded ranking. No successor fit or candidate combination is admitted by this result.\n\nValidation: optimized CUDA source a66ecef50848cc11160fc0c5a1f188355731ff98 and 31 focused tests pass. The run completed 31 backwards, 13,440 alternatives, 931 accepted changes and 391 native reloads, preserving 17 references and 380 original winners. The independent reader reproduces all saved transactions/ranking/pools (PASS, 112.3242s); this does not replicate backwards or the encoder. Actual-nine/full512/fresh/multi-turn are NOT_RUN because construction is negative. Python AST, JSON parse, claim-wording and diff checks pass. Later delivery commits change documentation/evidence only; executable source identity is checked separately.\n\nAll 546 outcome files passed archive inventory and fresh private-store download checks, then a separate laptop inventory check and iCloud MD5 round-trip. Pod 2g3n5a9casels1 was released and deleted after preservation. Full costs and setup failures are retained; model invocation 260.7328s, build 274.52s, pod uptime 1995s at $1.19/h (~$0.65946, excluding volume/storage). This temporary delivery branch and its worktree will be removed after fresh-main verification.\n\nReferences #2030. No serving mechanism or selected model changes.\n",
